SUMMARY:Interest List: Mindful Speed Dating Event 35-54
DESCRIPTION:Mindful Meet & Mingle – Asheville Singles\nThis is an applic
 ation-based event.\n\nhttps://forms.gle/RFrKuEAmrL8ApDUAA\n\nRSVP on Meetu
 p does not guarantee a spot.\nParticipation requires completing a short in
 terest form and receiving a private registration link. This is paid event.
  Please do not make travel plans or assume attendance until you receive a 
 confirmation email.\n\nhttps://forms.gle/RFrKuEAmrL8ApDUAA\n\nAbout Event\
 nMeet in the Moment is a guided\, speed-dating style experience for consci
 ous singles who want to slow down\, drop out of small talk\, and connect w
 ith presence and authenticity.\nThis is not traditional speed dating. Ther
 e is no pressure to perform\, impress\, or decide anything in the moment. 
 Instead\, you’ll be gently guided into embodied connection through simpl
 e mindfulness prompts\, structured one-on-one\nconversations\, and moments
  of reflection.\nThe intention is to help you feel grounded\, relaxed\, an
 d real while meeting others who value emotional availability\, curiosity\,
  and meaningful connection.\n\nWhat to Expect\n\n* A short opening groundi
 ng practice to help you arrive and settle\n* A series of timed\, one-on-on
 e conversations with gentle prompts\n* Clear structure so you can relax an
 d be yourself\n* Space to reflect and notice how connection feels in your 
 body\n* A warm\, inclusive\, and respectful environment\n\nYou do not need
  dating experience\, meditation experience\, or confidence in small talk. 
 Just come as you are.\n\nWho is this for\n\n* Singles who want deeper conn
 ection\, not surface-level chatting\n* People who value mindfulness\, emot
 ional awareness\, and authenticity\n* Those curious about meeting others i
 n a slower\, more intentional way\n* Anyone feeling tired of dating apps o
 r conventional speed dating\n\nImportant Notes\n\n* This event is designed
  for people who are emotionally available and open to respectful connectio
 n\n* You will never be asked to share anything you’re uncomfortable shar
 ing\n* Attraction is welcome\, but there is no expectation to match or fol
 low up\n\nTicketing & Balance\n\nTo support a balanced experience\, ticket
 s are offered by gender and capped to keep numbers even. If one ticket typ
 e sells out\, you may join the waitlist.\n\nWe run the event **every other
  month** with alternating age ranges: 35–54 and 55–74. Choose the sess
 ion that aligns with your life stage.
